sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Owner of one guest command
  participant L as Leader (bash), held unreaped
  participant G as Rest of the owned group
  participant F as Capture files
  Note over O: T0 - the owner chose timed_out or cancelled
  O->>L: SIGTERM to the group (killpg while L is unreaped)
  O->>G: same SIGTERM reaches every member
  alt leader exits within 2 s
    L-->>O: exit status (kept as termination.leaderStatus)
  else no exit by T0 + 2 s
    Note over O: grace ends
  end
  O->>L: SIGKILL to the group, still before the reap
  O->>G: same SIGKILL reaches every member
  O->>L: reap the leader
  loop signal-0 probe until ESRCH, at most 2 s after SIGKILL
    O->>G: kill(-pgid, 0)
  end
  Note over O,G: ESRCH gives groupEmpty yes. Members at the bound give no. EPERM gives unknown.
  O->>F: read each file up to its size, base64, bytes, SHA-256
  Note over O: record final, step times from T0, withinBounds true only for yes within bounds
